sequenceDiagram
    participant K as kubectl
    participant C as AWS credential plugin
    participant STS as AWS STS
    participant A as EKS API server
    participant E as EKS access entry
    participant R as Access policy or RBAC
    participant D as etcd

    K->>C: aws eks get-token
    C->>STS: Sign caller identity
    STS-->>C: Short-lived material
    C-->>K: Bearer token
    K->>A: HTTPS request
    A->>E: Authenticate IAM principal
    E-->>A: Kubernetes identity
    A->>R: Authorize verb/resource
    R-->>A: Allow or deny
    A->>D: Read or write object
    A-->>K: API response
